WEBVTT

NOTE Ekoleddwa ne faster-whisper base.en; source=vidiyo/Core/Mu maaso g'eriiso/FE_PEC_220p.mp4; sourceLang=olulimi Oluganda; omulimu=okuwandiika

1
00:00:01.240 --> 00:00:09.680
Akatambi kano kalaga engeri y’okukolamu okukebera amaaso mu maaso ng’okozesa...

2
00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:13.900
loopu y’ekitundu eky’omu maaso eky’ekyuma kya Arclight.

3
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:17.406
Tandika n’obuyonjo mu ngalo era weeyanjule.

4
00:00:17.406 --> 00:00:24.920
Kakasa nti omulwadde y’ali, nnyonnyola okukeberebwa, era ofune olukusa okukikola.

5
00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:29.470
Mu kusooka twala sekondi ntono okwetegereza amaaso gombi mu kiseera kye kimu.

6
00:00:29.470 --> 00:00:31.920
Laba periorbitor, ebikowe by’amaaso n’amaaso.

7
00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:38.160
Okwogera ku kuzimba kwonna, okumyuuka n’okufulumya amazzi, wamu n’okulabika kw’amaaso oba obutali bwa bulijjo

8
00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:40.680
ekifo ky’ebikoola by’amaaso.

9
00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:43.608
Oluvannyuma kola okukebera okunene ng’okozesa ekitangaala kya arc.

10
00:00:43.608 --> 00:00:45.560
Koleeza ettaala enjeru era...

11
00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:47.679
kwata ekyuma kino okumpi n’eriiso lyo.

12
00:00:47.679 --> 00:00:50.100
Sooka osemberere mpola eriiso ly’omulwadde erya ddyo okutuusa...

13
00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:51.220
kiri mu kussa essira.

14
00:00:51.220 --> 00:00:52.900
Kino kijja kuba ku sentimita nga 6.

15
00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:55.420
Nga omulwadde okutambuza eriiso lye ebweru era

16
00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:58.749
munda, olwo waggulu ne wansi, nga bwe bakwata mpola ebikowe by’amaaso gaabwe.

17
00:00:58.749 --> 00:01:00.080
Systematically okwetegereza eky’enjawulo

18
00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:02.675
ebizimbe ebirabibwa, nga bibirowoozaako mu bibinja.

19
00:01:02.675 --> 00:01:05.640
Ekibinja ekisooka kirimu eky’okungulu n’ekya wansi

20
00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:08.432
enviiri z’amaaso n’embalirira z’ebibikka.

21
00:01:08.432 --> 00:01:16.110
Ekyokubiri kirimu ekitundu ekiyitibwa conjunctiva ne sclera n’ebitundu by’omu maaso ebya wansi.

22
00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:20.425
Ekibinja eky’okusatu kye kitundu ky’amaaso ekiyitibwa cornea, ekikwatagana kino ne sclera ekiyitibwa

23
00:01:20.425 --> 00:01:21.350
ebitundu by’omubiri (limbis) ne

24
00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:23.579
akatuli akaddugavu ak’eriiso, eyeetooloddwa ekitundu ky’amaaso ekiyitibwa iris.

25
00:01:23.579 --> 00:01:26.550
Bw’omala okwetegereza ebizimbe bino byonna, kati

26
00:01:26.550 --> 00:01:29.190
Kati londa ettaala ya bbululu ku ttaala ya arc.

27
00:01:29.190 --> 00:01:34.310
Nga olina langi eyaka, firimu y’amaziga, ebitundu ebifiirwa epithelial n’obulwadde bijja kulagibwa.

28
00:01:34.310 --> 00:01:37.270
Ddaayi eno eyaka nnyo n’ekitangaala kya bbululu.

29
00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:42.430
Wandiika ku kifaananyi okulaba n’obunene bw’ebitundu ebifiirwa epithelial n’obulwadde.

30
00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:45.410
Malako ng’okebera ekyuma ekiyitibwa superior tarsal plate.

31
00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:50.030
Teeka ekikuta kya ppamba ku kibikka ekya waggulu, olwo ositule mpola enviiri waggulu ng’ogenda mpola

32
00:01:50.030 --> 00:01:52.550
okunyiga wansi n’ekikolo.

33
00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:57.562
okwetegereza n’eriiso, olwo leeta ekitangaala kya arc okulaba nga kikuziddwa.

34
00:01:57.562 --> 00:01:58.230
Ddamu kino

35
00:01:58.230 --> 00:02:00.130
okukeberebwa ku liiso eddala.

36
00:02:00.130 --> 00:02:03.550
Oluvannyuma weebaze omulwadde, mufunze era owandiike by’ozudde

37
00:02:03.550 --> 00:02:04.614
n’okuddamu okuyonja emikono.

38
00:02:04.614 --> 00:02:08.070
Nsaba otunuulire ettaala yaffe endala eya University of St Andrews Arc Light

39
00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:08.990
Vidiyo za pulojekiti.
